    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> —</p><p>You negate the damage dealt to a creature within a range of 30 feet of you as an immediate action. The amount of negated damage is equal to the amount of MGP expended × 3. If the creature is hit by multiple attacks in a single action, such as through natural or iterative attacks, tally up the total damage before utilizing this gambit to nullify it. Complete negation of all damage is necessary for this gambit to take effect.</p>",
